THIRD-PARTY VENDORED ARTIFACTS
==============================

This directory contains a small set of third-party SKY130 library artifacts that
are NOT authored by the HCMUT_DICD course. They are redistributed here so the
back-end flow (STA / APR / gate-sim) is self-contained. Attribution and licenses:

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_sram_macros/  --  SRAM hard macro
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Macro:   sky130_sram_1kbyte_1rw1r_32x256_8   (256 words x 32 bit, 1RW+1R, 8-bit
         write mask) -- the exact macro HW3 (conv_engine) and HW5 (APR) use.
Views:   lib/  ...TT_1p8V_25C.lib   (typical-corner timing, for STA)
         lef/  ....lef               (abstract, for placement)
         gds/  ....gds               (layout, for stream-out)
         verilog/ ....v, ....bb.v    (behavioral model + blackbox stub)

Origin:  Generated by OpenRAM for the SkyWater SKY130 process. The macro files
         are OpenRAM / Google SKY130 artifacts, licensed Apache-2.0.
         <https://github.com/VLSIDA/OpenRAM>  <https://github.com/google/skywater-pdk>

